	<div class="fsElement fsNavigation fsList nav-main" id="fsEl_9026" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<nav><ul class="fsNavLevel1"><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/about-allen">About Allen</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><div class="fsNavPageDescription"><h3>About Allen</h3>
<em>The purpose of Allen Community College is to provide quality educational and support services in an atmosphere that is caring, safe, and conducive to learning.  The college is committed to a wide range of accessible, affordable educational programs that enable students to reach their academic, occupational, and personal potential.</em><br>
<br>
<a data-page-name="About Allen" href="/fs/pages/825">Learn More</a></div><ul class="fsNavLevel2"><li><a href="/about-allen/proud-past">Proud Past</a></li><li><a href="/about-allen/strategic-plan">Planning for a Brighter Future</a></li><li><a href="/about-allen/leadership">Leadership</a></li><li><a href="/about-allen/accreditation">Accreditation</a></li><li><a href="/resources/community-information">Allen County Community</a></li><li><a href="/about-allen/economic-value-of-allen">Economic Value of Allen</a></li><li><a href="/about-allen/consumer-information">Consumer Information</a></li><li><a href="/about-allen/policies-regulations">Policies &amp; Regulations</a></li><li><a href="/about-allen/institutional-compliance-information">Institutional Compliance Information</a></li><li><a href="/about-allen/vendor-opportunities-rfps">Vendor Opportunities - RFPs</a></li><li><a href="/about-allen/opportunity-meets-community">Opportunity Meets Community</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/prospective-students">Prospective Students</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><div class="fsNavPageDescription"><h3>Become an Allen Red Devil in 5 easy steps.</h3>
<br>
Take the first step to joining the Allen Community! Complete our free application.</div><ul class="fsNavLevel2"><li><a href="/prospective-students/high-school-student">High School Student</a></li><li><a href="/prospective-students/international">International</a></li><li><a href="/prospective-students">In-Person &amp; Online Student</a></li><li><a href="/paying-for-college/veteran-services">Active-Duty Military &amp; Veterans</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/paying-for-college">Paying for College</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><div class="fsNavPageDescription"><h3>Financial Aid</h3>
<br>
Don't wait to find the funds you need. Early completion of your FAFSA and any necessary documents allows for a more timely preview of the financial aid available to you. Please feel free to contact our office if you have any questions.<br>
<br>
<a data-page-name="Paying for College" href="/fs/pages/831">Learn More</a></div><ul class="fsNavLevel2"><li><a href="/paying-for-college/financial-aid">Financial Aid</a></li><li><a href="/paying-for-college/aid-types">Aid Types</a></li><li><a href="/paying-for-college/aid-types/allen-scholarships">Scholarships</a></li><li><a href="https://studentaid.gov/h/apply-for-aid/fafsa ">FAFSA Application</a></li><li><a href="/paying-for-college/pay-my-bill">Pay my Bill</a></li><li><a href="/tuition-fees">Tuition</a></li><li><a href="/paying-for-college/financial-aid-calendar">Financial Aid Calendar</a></li><li><a href="/paying-for-college/veteran-services">Active-Duty Military &amp; Veteran Services</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/academics">Academics</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><div class="fsNavPageDescription"><h3>Academic Opportunities</h3>
<br>
Allen offers a wide verity of opportunities that fit anyone's needs. Our academic options provide education, that work with your schedule at an affordable price, without sacrificing quality.<br>
<br>
<a data-page-name="Academics" href="/fs/pages/838">Learn More</a></div><ul class="fsNavLevel2"><li><a href="/academics/apprenticeships">Apprenticeships</a></li><li><a href="/academics/certificates">Certificates</a></li><li><a href="/academics/programs">Programs</a></li><li><a href="/resources/students/advising">Enroll</a></li><li><a href="/academics/course-schedule">Course Schedule</a></li><li><a href="/academics/registrar">Registrar</a></li><li><a href="/academics/dates-deadlines">Dates &amp; Deadlines</a></li><li><a href="https://allencc.simplesyllabus.com/en-US/syllabus-library">Course Syllabi</a></li><li><a href="/academics/ed2go">ed2go</a></li><li><a href="/academics/final-exams">Final Exams</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/activitiesathletics">Activities/Athletics</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><div class="fsNavPageDescription"><h3>Activities/Athletics</h3>
At Allen, community is what you become a part of. Generations of Red Devils have made life-long friendships and grown as individuals. We offer a variety of unique options that are sure to peak your interest and, get you involved. <br>
<br>
<a data-page-name="Activities/Athletics" href="/fs/pages/839" target="_blank">Learn More</a><br>
 </div><ul class="fsNavLevel2"><li><a href="https://www.allenreddevils.com/landing/index">Red Devil Athletics</a></li><li><a href="/activitiesathletics/student-activities">Student Activities</a></li><li><a href="/activitiesathletics/fine-performing-arts">Fine &amp; Performing Arts</a></li><li><a href="/activitiesathletics/allen-flame-newspaper">Allen Flame - Newspaper</a></li><li><a href="/activitiesathletics/disc-golf-course">Disc Golf Course</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/community">Community</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><div class="fsNavPageDescription"><h3>Community</h3>
Our diverse student population that ranges from our traditional students on campus, non-traditional students, to the students who make up our largest population of students within our online learning community, one thing remains true, whether you are a traditional, non-traditional, or online student, we are all one Allen.<br>
<br>
<a data-page-name="Community" href="/fs/pages/843" target="_blank">Learn More</a><br>
 </div><ul class="fsNavLevel2"><li><a href="/community/endowed-scholarships">Endowed Scholarships</a></li><li><a href="/community/donors">Boosters</a></li><li><a href="/community/tax-credit-opportunities">Tax Credit Opportunities</a></li><li><a href="/community/naming-campaign">Neil Crane Court Naming Campaign</a></li><li><a href="/community/alumni">Alumni</a></li><li><a href="https://allencc.kindful.com">Make a Gift</a></li><li><a href="/community/scarlet-black-club">Scarlet &amp; Black Club</a></li><li><a href="/resources/community-information">Community Information</a></li><li><a href="https://allen.events.prod.coursedog.com/" target="_blank">Schedule/Request an Event<span class="fsStyleSROnly" data-nosnippet="">(opens in new window/tab)</span></a></li></ul></div></li></ul></nav>
	</div>


	</div>
	


	</div>


	</div>
	


