							<div class="fsPageLayout fsLayout fsOneColumnLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8429" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8430"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsResourceElement fsSlideshow hero fsSlideshowHorizontal fsStatePlaying" id="fsEl_9029" data-use-new="true" data-source-element-id="9029" data-source-page-id="821" data-display-items="collections_and_resources" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<div class="fsElementSlideshow" data-adaptive-height="true" data-arrows="true" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-speed="4000" data-dots="false" data-fade="true" data-slides-to-show="1" data-slideshow-item-label="Resource item" data-slideshow-label="" data-tabbable-slides="false" data-vertical="false"><fieldset aria-controls="fsEl_9029" aria-label="slideshow controls" class="fsElementSlideshowControls"><button aria-hidden="false" aria-label="pause slideshow" class="fsSlideshowPause" value="pause slideshow"><span class="fsStyleSROnly">pause slideshow</span></button><button aria-hidden="true" aria-label="play slideshow" class="fsSlideshowPlay fsStateHidden" value="play slideshow"><span class="fsStyleSROnly">play slideshow</span></button></fieldset><article class="fsResource fsStyleAutoclear fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="A smiling graduate in the foreground looks towards a blurred background of other graduates and a banner that reads %22YOUR NEXT STEP IS... HERE%22 with university logos." data-aspect-ratio="0.461875" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1788184483/allenccedu/iqsd06u4uoe9etmsdz5p/HERE.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1788184483/allenccedu/iqsd06u4uoe9etmsdz5p/HERE.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1788184483/allenccedu/iqsd06u4uoe9etmsdz5p/HERE.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1788184483/allenccedu/iqsd06u4uoe9etmsdz5p/HERE.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1788184483/allenccedu/iqsd06u4uoe9etmsdz5p/HERE.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="Bachelor's Degrees" data-resource-uuid="33598675-02e1-44d9-9203-deb33ea8a697"></picture><figcaption id="fsRes_2278_figcaption"><div class="fsTitle fsResourceTitle">Bachelor's Degrees</div><p>Earn a Bachelor's Degree HERE - Presented by Allen Community College and Newman University </p>

<p><a href="https://accnewman.com/" target="_blank">Learn More HERE!</a></p></figcaption></figure></article><article class="fsResource fsStyleAutoclear fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="" data-aspect-ratio="0.4271128757799206" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1775834118/allenccedu/l07ejayplnfzxsddkngo/red-dev-enroll.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1775834118/allenccedu/l07ejayplnfzxsddkngo/red-dev-enroll.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1775834118/allenccedu/l07ejayplnfzxsddkngo/red-dev-enroll.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1775834118/allenccedu/l07ejayplnfzxsddkngo/red-dev-enroll.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1775834118/allenccedu/l07ejayplnfzxsddkngo/red-dev-enroll.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1775834118/allenccedu/l07ejayplnfzxsddkngo/red-dev-enroll.jpg%22,%22width%22:1763}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="Become a Red Devil!" data-resource-uuid="3f7e8714-d051-4cd8-89d8-fe7f241e211c"></picture><figcaption id="fsRes_2173_figcaption"><div class="fsTitle fsResourceTitle">Become a Red Devil!</div><p>Allen Community College</p>

<p>Where Opportunity Meets Community!</p>

<p><a href="https://accportal.jenzabarcloud.com/ICS/Admissions/Admissions_Homepage.jnz?portlet=J1_FormFlow_-_Forms&amp;screen=FormView&amp;form=cdd1b7e4-bea0-466a-a0c4-1f36c4482fbf" target="_blank">Apply Now!</a></p></figcaption></figure></article><article class="fsResource fsStyleAutoclear fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="Campus Store" data-aspect-ratio="0.42168674698795183" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1789574394/allenccedu/xskk7xdrentzbtbjzzjb/bookstore-slider.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1789574394/allenccedu/xskk7xdrentzbtbjzzjb/bookstore-slider.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1789574394/allenccedu/xskk7xdrentzbtbjzzjb/bookstore-slider.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1789574394/allenccedu/xskk7xdrentzbtbjzzjb/bookstore-slider.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1789574394/allenccedu/xskk7xdrentzbtbjzzjb/bookstore-slider.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1789574394/allenccedu/xskk7xdrentzbtbjzzjb/bookstore-slider.jpg%22,%22width%22:1660}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="Campus Store" data-resource-uuid="d6840c4b-211b-44c9-8508-7b9c6740c873"></picture><figcaption id="fsRes_2314_figcaption"><div class="fsTitle fsResourceTitle">Campus Store</div><p>The ACC Bookstore is online for all your textbooks and apparel needs. Shop online and show your Red Devil Spirit!</p>

<p><a href="https://www.allencc.edu/resources/students/services/bookstore" target="_blank"><span class="fs_style_18"><strong>Visit Now!</strong></span></a></p></figcaption></figure></article><article class="fsResource fsStyleAutoclear fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="" data-aspect-ratio="0.3926345609065156" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1790366601/allenccedu/bmcpqahaxwkd8xunxf5i/FAFSA-WEB-SLIDER-27-28.png%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1790366601/allenccedu/bmcpqahaxwkd8xunxf5i/FAFSA-WEB-SLIDER-27-28.png%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1790366601/allenccedu/bmcpqahaxwkd8xunxf5i/FAFSA-WEB-SLIDER-27-28.png%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1790366601/allenccedu/bmcpqahaxwkd8xunxf5i/FAFSA-WEB-SLIDER-27-28.png%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1790366601/allenccedu/bmcpqahaxwkd8xunxf5i/FAFSA-WEB-SLIDER-27-28.png%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1790366601/allenccedu/bmcpqahaxwkd8xunxf5i/FAFSA-WEB-SLIDER-27-28.png%22,%22width%22:1765}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="FAFSA 2027-2028" data-resource-uuid="1658493a-2109-4995-8a71-4ad19dcc36dd"></picture><figcaption id="fsRes_2327_figcaption"><div class="fsTitle fsResourceTitle">FAFSA 2027-2028</div><p>Allen's School Code is 001901</p>

<p><a href="https://studentaid.gov/h/apply-for-aid/fafsa" target="_blank"><span class="fs_style_18">FAFSA Application</span></a></p>

<p>Email <a href="mailto:finaid@allencc.edu" target="_blank">finaid@allencc.edu</a> for questions</p></figcaption></figure></article><article class="fsResource fsStyleAutoclear fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="KS Promise Scholarship" data-aspect-ratio="0.35224839400428265" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1785445410/allenccedu/jnra96fw8cbbxkimu1ox/KS_Scholarship.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1785445410/allenccedu/jnra96fw8cbbxkimu1ox/KS_Scholarship.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1785445410/allenccedu/jnra96fw8cbbxkimu1ox/KS_Scholarship.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1785445410/allenccedu/jnra96fw8cbbxkimu1ox/KS_Scholarship.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1785445410/allenccedu/jnra96fw8cbbxkimu1ox/KS_Scholarship.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1785445410/allenccedu/jnra96fw8cbbxkimu1ox/KS_Scholarship.jpg%22,%22width%22:1868}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="Kansas Promise Scholarship" data-resource-uuid="9c93996c-86d1-410c-90f4-424ce062e8e2"></picture><figcaption id="fsRes_2262_figcaption"><div class="fsTitle fsResourceTitle">Kansas Promise Scholarship</div><p>Promise Scholarship covers tuition, fees, and other costs not covered by other scholarships and grants.</p>

<p><a href="https://www.allencc.edu/kansas-promise-scholarship" target="_blank">APPLY NOW!</a></p></figcaption></figure></article><article class="fsResource fsStyleAutoclear fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="" data-aspect-ratio="0.364625" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1784822138/allenccedu/c5t1ficcdl1peghbjrdv/CDLprogramslider.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1784822138/allenccedu/c5t1ficcdl1peghbjrdv/CDLprogramslider.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1784822138/allenccedu/c5t1ficcdl1peghbjrdv/CDLprogramslider.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1784822138/allenccedu/c5t1ficcdl1peghbjrdv/CDLprogramslider.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_5/v1784822138/allenccedu/c5t1ficcdl1peghbjrdv/CDLprogramslider.jpg%22,%22width%22:1600},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_6/v1784822138/allenccedu/c5t1ficcdl1peghbjrdv/CDLprogramslider.jpg%22,%22width%22:2200}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="CDL Training Program" data-resource-uuid="a2a1a2c0-e740-494f-a992-2d2cd4142736"></picture><figcaption id="fsRes_2258_figcaption"><div class="fsTitle fsResourceTitle">CDL Training Program</div><ul>
	<li>Earn Kansas Class A or B CDL</li>
	<li>Five-Week Program</li>
	<li>Hands on Training</li>
	<li>High Demand Career Opportunities</li>
</ul>

